From d1d9e053d0d4a495ba76ffb84040425103c19f65 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Date: Thu, 23 Mar 2023 15:20:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ascend-milan-support-hns-roce

---
 drivers/infiniband/hw/hns/Makefile            |  13 +-
